title: Where others may matter more than me.
pid: 1971a1b2-b899-41dd-aeda-dcd216d52fd9
body: |2-
  Vic would know whether the diff view can take a foreign skgrepo at all. The "Reference to unknown node." headlines, which carry the IDs of private notes into a public reader's view, are a question for privacy, Praveen's if he is born. My reading came after Git had already shown me Jeff's sketch, so my comparison with it is not blind.
